{
  "id": "黄帝",
  "name": "黄帝",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "deity",
  "typeConfidence": "medium",
  "description": null,
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 14,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-14-18",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "光如日月，其声如雷，其名曰夔。黄帝得之，以其皮为鼓，橛以雷兽之骨"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "水之西，有朝云之国、司彘之国。黄帝妻雷祖，生昌意。昌意降处若水，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-19",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "黄帝生骆明，骆明生白马，白马是为鲧"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "soushenji-01-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "赤将子舆者，黄帝时人也。不食五谷，而啖百草华。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-03-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "是故其德烦而不能一。乃至神农、黄帝，剖判大宗，窍领天地，袭九窾，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-04-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "徽，其日丙丁。中央，土也，其帝黄帝，其佐后土，执绳而制四方，其神"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-06-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "以息壤堙洪水之州，东至于碣石，黄帝、后土之所司者，万二千里。其令"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-07-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "马，此以弗御御之者也。\n\n昔者黄帝治天下，而力牧、太山稽辅之，以"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 12,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-12-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "相遗也；其国治者，君臣相忘也。黄帝曰：“芒芒昧昧，从天之道，与元"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-18-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "不得不中绝。兵之所由来者远矣！黄帝尝与炎帝战矣，颛顼尝与共工争矣"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 19,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-19-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "暑之势不易，小变不足以妨大节。黄帝生阴阳，上骈生耳目，桑林生臂手"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 21,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-21-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "疾，迟之为速者，则几于道矣。故黄帝亡其玄珠，使离朱，捷剟索之，而"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 22,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-22-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "而贱今，故为道者必托之于神农、黄帝而后能入说。乱世暗主，高远其所"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 23,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-23-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "矢，中之具，而非所以中也。\n\n黄帝曰：“芒芒昧昧，因天之威，与元"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "shanhaijing",
    "chapterIndex": 14
  }
}
